*.tsbuildinfo

# lib/ is committed on purpose (unlike a normal TS package).
# A git-hosted install — `dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:qingyou002/dsh-auto-handoff` —
# must ship the prebuilt host half (lib/index.js) and browser half (lib/client.js),
# because pnpm refuses to run a git dependency's `prepare` script unless the profile
# allowlists that exact git spec under `allowBuilds`. Rebuild and commit lib/ with
# every src/ change (`npm run build`).
